# Folder layout

See **[`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)** table for authoritative roles.

| Folder | Role |
|--------|------|
| `Gameplay/` | Decide + GameLoop / systems |
| `World/` | Terrain, Blocks, palettes, chests, floor drops |
| `Geometry/` | AABB / spatial math (no World/Player) |
| `Player/` | Player, intents, inventory, manager |
| `Server/` | Boot, config, identity, context |
| `Packets/` | Wire models — serialize only |
| `Protocol/` | Transmit decided outcomes |
| `Session/` | Inbound SM — handlers, NetworkSession, PlayerVisibility |

Leaf libs (`libs/nbt`, `libs/leveldb`, `src/raknet`) never reference `zenith`.
